msgid "One game of pool costs 800 yen."
msgstr "Una partita a biliardo costa 800 yen."

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Uncle Kaz, try and get a combination shot in nine-ball!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"The young lady is quite knowledgeable! Do you know what a combination shot "
"is, sir?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"It's using the cue ball to hit an object ball, which in turn hits another "
